# Google Maps key for the NATIVE map rendering only (home-tab map).
# Restrict it in Google Cloud Console to "Maps SDK for Android" (+ iOS if you build
# for iOS) — mobile-native map rendering is free/unlimited, and Places autocomplete
# goes through the backend proxy, so this key is worthless if extracted.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* vars are inlined into the JS bundle at build/publish time.
# For EAS builds/updates set this as an EAS environment variable instead:
#   eas env:create --name EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY --value <key> --environment preview
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_maps_sdk_only_key_here
